flowchart TD
  P[Producers<br/>orders · auth · campaigns] --> API[Notification API<br/>validate · idempotency key]
  API --> R[Router<br/>prefs · dedup · quiet hours · caps · template]
  R --> Q[Priority queues<br/>critical · transactional · bulk]
  R <-.-> SCH[(Deferred sends)]
  Q --> W[Channel workers<br/>rate-limited per provider]
  W --> CH[Push · SMS with fallback<br/>email · in-app inbox]
  CH -. receipts .-> TR[(sent · delivered · opened)]
